    <description>This relies on the Price Book Selector CMDT and the Price Book and Record Type mapped in the record there. If the Price Book has a name change or is deactivated without the CMDT record being updated, this automation will stop working.

9/26 - Added safeguard to set the Price Book if it was not set at record creation.

7/26 -  This creates an Opportunity Product based on the Product from the Product Mix record. This is needed to send to Netsuite.
https://hansonwadegroup.atlassian.net/jira/servicedesk/projects/HTT/queues/custom/124/HTT-42155</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Opportunity - Update - Won Spex Opp {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Opportunity - Update - Won Spex Opp</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
